    "text": "Where is the clean air? Where are the anti-smog guns and vehicles? And where have the billions gone? Despite Rs. 123 billion allocated for smog prevention in FY 2025–26 and a $300 million World Bank-approved clean air program, Lahore continues to choke.\n\nThe Punjab government must explain how much has actually been spent and what results have been achieved.\nLahore needs clean air, not publicity stunts and hollow promises!\n\n#LahoreSmog #PunjabGovernment #AirPollution",
